eal brainrots from other players \ud83d\udc0a\u2708\ufe0f\n- Generate money \ud83d\udc18\ud83c\udf35\n- Rebirth for rewards \ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udede\n- Buy slaps and items to troll other players \ud83e\udd88\ud83d\udc5f\n\nRemember, other players will try to steal from you too! \ud83e\udd4a\n", "short_description": "\ud83e\udd8d Welcome to Steal a Monke - Steal a Brainrot in VR \ud83e\udd8d\n\nYou like to steal. You really, REALLY like to steal. Buy and steal brainrots to earn big money! Rebirth and unlock crazy rewards to troll other players! Stay tuned for weekly updates!\n\n\ud83e\udd2a How to Play\n\n- Buy a brainrot \ud83e\udd64\ud83e\udd77\n- Steal brainrots from other players \ud83d\udc0a\u2708\ufe0f\n- Generate money \ud83d\udc18\ud83c\udf35\n- Rebirth for rewards \ud83d\udc38\ud83d\udede\n- Buy slaps and items to troll other players \ud83e\udd88\ud83d\udc5f\n\nRemember, other players will try to steal from you too! \ud83e\udd4a\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://auravision.xyz/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Enver Studio LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://auravision.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25426109233745975"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-or